  "question": {
    "text": "In the circle given below, let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>O</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math> unit, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>O</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>13</mn></math> unit and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mi>Q</mi><mo>&#8869;</mo><mi>O</mi><mi>B</mi></math>. Then, the area of the triangle <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mi>Q</mi><mi>B</mi></math> (in square units) is :<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/055d5bb5-1dbb-49fe-9188-66ba4ed62258-image.png\" style=\"width: 315px; height: 230px;\" /></p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "wVZTP",
